! Original OpenSwing gust-mode comparison reference, SI units.
! Set speed=10, alpha=0, gravity=0, Mach=0 and use a fixed frame.
! A drag point at (1.2,.6,-.3) has CDA=.4. For a unit Earth-z gust:
! Fz = .5*rho*CDA*U * {cos,sin}(pi*n*.6) * exp(-i*omega*1.2/U).
! The two sensors and Engine 1 provide station and unlike-unit comparisons.
Name
Gust-mode phase demonstrator
End
Unit
L 1 m
T 1 s
F 1 N
End
Constant
9.80665 1.225 340.294
End
Reference
2 1 2
End
Ground
1 0 0
End
Weight
1 0 1.2 .6 -.3 0 .4 0
End
Engine
1 0 1 0 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0
End
Sensor
1 1 0 0 0 .2
2 1 2 .3 2 .2
End
Beam 1
Rigid reference axis
t y
0 0
2 2
End
